source: crates/lobo-cli/tests/help_parity.rs
expression: "String::from_utf8(output).unwrap()"
---
Live dashboard of the running pod

Usage:
  lobo status [OPTIONS]

Flags:
      --json[=<JSON>]  print one snapshot as JSON (pod, release, agent status) and exit
      --once[=<ONCE>]  print one snapshot and exit
  -h, --help           help for status

Global Flags:
      --config <string>  config file (dotenv; the OS env is never read) [default: /home/u/.config/lobo/config.env]
